      "analysis": "{\"objectType\":\"two-story anime house\",\"objectClass\":\"hard-surface\",\"complexity\":\"complex\",\"identityFeatures\":[\"hipped red-tiled roof with second small hip roof on top\",\"white stucco walls with large window bands\",\"second-floor balcony with white railing\",\"ground-floor carport with translucent blue roof\",\"yellow/green tiled boundary wall with hedge and bamboo gate\",\"brown front door with small entry roof\",\"rooftop TV antenna\"],\"camera\":{\"azimuthDeg\":-20,\"elevationDeg\":8,\"note\":\"front-left of house, near eye level, second view is a higher aerial rotate\"},\"partPlan\":[{\"part\":\"ground floor volume\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.28,\"top\":0.55,\"width\":0.42,\"height\":0.28},\"primitives\":\"box for the main lower story mass since walls are flat and rectilinear\",\"details\":\"white stucco finish with inset window cutouts and brick accent strip near door\"},{\"part\":\"upper floor volume\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.36,\"top\":0.28,\"width\":0.24,\"height\":0.27},\"primitives\":\"smaller box set back and centered on ground floor to form the second story\",\"details\":\"white walls, window band on front and side faces\"},{\"part\":\"lower hip roof\",\"approach\":\"revolved\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.24,\"top\":0.48,\"width\":0.5,\"height\":0.14},\"primitives\":\"lathe or prism shaped into a 4-sided hip pyramid to cover the ground floor\",\"details\":\"red tile finish, roof overhangs walls by ~15% on all sides, includes rain gutters at eaves\"},{\"part\":\"upper hip roof\",\"approach\":\"revolved\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.32,\"top\":0.05,\"width\":0.32,\"height\":0.24},\"primitives\":\"lathe/cone-based hip roof, steeper pitch, centered above upper floor\",\"details\":\"matching red tile finish, small ridge cap at apex\"},{\"part\":\"balcony\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.36,\"top\":0.24,\"width\":0.15,\"height\":0.13},\"primitives\":\"flat plate for balcony floor plus thin box/cylinder posts and roundedBox top rail for railing\",\"details\":\"vertical railing slats repeated ~8-10 times across balcony width, white finish\"},{\"part\":\"front entry door + porch roof\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.6,\"top\":0.62,\"width\":0.06,\"height\":0.15},\"primitives\":\"box for door slab inset into wall, small flat plane/prism as tiny overhang roof above it\",\"details\":\"brown wood finish on door, small doorbell/mailbox box beside it in brick color\"},{\"part\":\"carport\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.7,\"top\":0.55,\"width\":0.2,\"height\":0.14},\"primitives\":\"thin roundedBox or plane for slanted translucent roof supported by cylinder posts\",\"details\":\"semi-transparent blue-glass finish, attached to right side of house, car parked beneath\"},{\"part\":\"boundary wall + hedge\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.16,\"top\":0.72,\"width\":0.65,\"height\":0.13},\"primitives\":\"long box for wall with alternating yellow/green tile texture and a box/blob hedge sitting on top\",\"details\":\"tile pattern repeated as a 2-color checker finish, green blob hedge repeated along the wall run, bamboo lattice gate segment (flatRing/extrudedPolygon lattice) near carport entrance\"},{\"part\":\"front gate & mailbox pillar\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.58,\"top\":0.68,\"width\":0.06,\"height\":0.17},\"primitives\":\"box pillar in brick-red finish with small plate mailbox/intercom detail\",\"details\":\"brick texture finish, small dark rectangle intercom decal\"},{\"part\":\"rooftop antenna\",\"approach\":\"boxy\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.49,\"top\":0.02,\"width\":0.06,\"height\":0.06},\"primitives\":\"thin cylinder mast with several short crossbar boxes for a TV antenna\",\"details\":\"simple metallic grey finish, mounted at roof apex\"},{\"part\":\"windows (front & side bands)\",\"approach\":\"flat-cutout\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.3,\"top\":0.3,\"width\":0.42,\"height\":0.3},\"primitives\":\"flat plane/roundedPlate insets with glass-blue tint set into wall boxes\",\"details\":\"repeat as grid of vertical-pane windows on both floors, light-blue glossy glass finish with white frame trim\"},{\"part\":\"shrubs/trees around house\",\"approach\":\"rounded-shell\",\"bbox\":{\"left\":0.1,\"top\":0.55,\"width\":0.85,\"height\":0.3},\"primitives\":\"blob clusters for rounded hedge/tree masses flanking the house\",\"details\":\"several overlapping green blobs of varying scale scattered along front and sides, not structural\"}],\"attachments\":[\"upper floor volume centered-above ground floor volume\",\"lower hip roof flush-top ground floor volume\",\"upper hip roof centered-above upper floor volume\",\"balcony attached-front upper floor volume\",\"front entry door inset-into ground floor volume\",\"carport attached-right ground floor volume\",\"boundary wall attached-front ground floor volume\",\"front gate & mailbox pillar inset-into boundary wall\",\"rooftop antenna centered-above upper hip roof\",\"windows inset-into ground floor volume\",\"windows inset-into upper floor volume\",\"shrubs/trees rests-on boundary wall\"],\"buildRecipe\":[\"Establish ground floor as a wide low box (~2.2:1 width:height) and stack a narrower upper floor box (~60% of ground floor width) set back near the rear/left, both walls white.\",\"Build the lower hip roof as a 4-panel pyramid sitting flush on the ground floor, overhanging walls by about 15% on each side, painted uniform red-tile with visible ridge lines.\",\"Build a second, steeper hip roof for the upper floor centered above it, smaller footprint but same red-tile finish, meeting at a peak where the antenna mast attaches.\",\"Place the balcony on the front-left face of the upper floor: a flat white deck plate with a railing made of ~8 thin vertical posts capped by a horizontal rail bar.\",\"Window bands: front ground floor gets 2-3 wide vertical-pane windows near center-left, upper floor front gets 2 tall windows plus the balcony door; side faces (visible in aerial view) repeat similar window rhythm at smaller scale.\",\"Attach the carport to the right side of the ground floor as a slanted single-pane translucent blue-glass roof on two thin support posts, angled downward away from the house, with a car silhouette parked beneath.\",\"Model the entry door (brown, inset into wall) roughly centered-right on the ground floor front, topped by a tiny flat overhang roof; place a small brick-red pillar with intercom/mailbox plate immediately to its right.\",\"Construct the boundary wall as a long low box spanning the full front width, textured with alternating yellow and green square tiles (checker repeat), topped by a continuous green hedge blob row and interrupted by a bamboo-lattice sliding gate near the carport gap.\",\"Scatter blob-shaped hedges/trees at both front corners and along the right side fence for greenery, larger dense blobs at left corner near the sidewalk.\",\"Add a thin cylindrical TV antenna mast with 2-3 small crossbar prongs at the very apex of the upper roof.\",\"Keep all hard-surface parts crisp-edged (boxy/lathe forms) — no organic deformation; reserve blob primitive only for hedges/shrubs.\",\"Maintain roof color (brick red) consistent between both hip roofs and small door overhang for visual unity.\"]}",
